# Qwen4 Max — findings by Inkling 2 Small

- Source: Alibaba Cloud / Qwen (`qwen-4-max`)
- Date: 2026-11-11 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen4 Max (preview model ID `qwen4-max-preview`)
- **Short description:** Alibaba Cloud's next-generation flagship multimodal model in the Qwen family — "text generation, image and video understanding, and deep reasoning"; designed for coding, office productivity, frontend design, and complex agentic tasks. First publicly callable Qwen4-generation model; in preview, not yet generally released.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (BaiLian), **Token Plan only** — pay-as-you-go is not supported. Dedicated Token Plan base URL (e.g. `https://token-plan.ap-southeast-1.maas.aliyuncs.com`, endpoint per Token Plan guide). OpenAI Chat Completions / Responses and Anthropic Messages API compatible. No open weights.
- **Release / knowledge:** preview window opened 2026-11-11 10:00 UTC+8 and runs to 24:00 on 2026-11-25 UTC+8; "no changes will be made during this period, and the model will be retired after the preview ends" (official doc, last updated 2026-11-11). Knowledge cutoff not published.
- **IDs:** `qwen4-max-preview` (preview only; no GA/pay-as-you-go ID yet)
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens (official doc). Maximum output **393,216 tokens**, shared by thinking and the final answer (official doc). Output-budget behavior changed with this model: `max_tokens` now equals `max_completion_tokens` and limits thinking + answer combined.
- **Modalities:** text, images, and video in; text out; reasoning yes — thinking enabled by default, adjustable via `reasoning_effort` (`low` / `medium` / `xhigh`, default `xhigh`); tool calling yes (Function Calling, web search, built-in tools); structured outputs yes (JSON Object / JSON Schema).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-11):** no pay-as-you-go per-token price — Token Plan subscription only (credit-based); no published per-1M price. Not free.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed. Alibaba has not published parameter counts, active params, or architecture; Qwen4 is described as building on the sparse design previewed by Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (n-gram embedding layer + sparse attention) — that is inference from vendor statements, not a published spec for this ID.

### Raw benchmarks found

ZERO verified public benchmark numbers found for `qwen4-max-preview` (the exact model/ID). Confirmed via Alibaba Cloud official model doc (specs only — no benchmark table), BenchLM (`qwen4-max`, "Benchmark data is coming soon", 0 of 815 covered, "Coming soon" as of 2026-11-11), and web search for `qwen4-max-preview` + SWE-bench / benchmark / AIME / GPQA (no results). Alibaba has not published parameter counts, benchmarks, or weights (Yotta Labs, 2026-11-11). Nothing scored is reproducible for this exact ID.

